SUMMARY:Anytime Fitness - CAP
DESCRIPTION:Anytime Fitness Gym\, every Monday\, from 11  AM to 12  PM.\nLIMIT 5. \nLight refreshments will be served.\nSPACE IS LIMITED!! \nTo register for an activity or for more information\, please contact:\nJonathan Hinkis – 973-334- 3496 ext. 514 \nWeekdays 9:00 AM to 5:00 PM \n***ACTIVITIES SUBJECT TO CHANGE AND/OR CANCELLATION***
