SUMMARY:Monday Meet Ups
DESCRIPTION:Monday Meet Up is a social drop in group for adults between the ages of 20 to 30. \nCoping with a mental health condition? You’re not alone! We’re building a community this summer with a series of weekly meet ups starting on Monday\, June 8 at 5pm with a pizza party. \nWith questions or to RSVP contact Ann at Akoenig@mhainspire.org or Alexa at AMastrangelo@mhainspire.org. \nWhere: MHA\n33 South Fullerton Avenue\nMontclair\, NJ 07042 \nWhen: Every Monday from June 8 to July 27 \nTime: 5 PM to 6 PM \nCheck out the flyer\, here.
URL:https://www.mhainspire.org/event/monday-meet-ups/2026-06-22/
CATEGORIES:Support Groups
END:VEVENT
